{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pulls/12204","id":4144477078,"node_id":"PR_kwDOOCjvss73B7OW","html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12204","diff_url":"https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12204.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12204.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/12204","number":12204,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(llm): GLM-5.2 chat template compatibility — argument normalization and tool_call recovery","user":{"login":"peilii","id":76031090,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MDMxMDkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76031090?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/peilii","html_url":"https://github.com/peilii","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peilii/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peilii/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peilii/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peilii/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peilii/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peilii/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peilii/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peilii/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peilii/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\nGLM-5.2's Jinja chat template calls `.items()` on tool-call arguments, expecting a parsed dict rather than the OpenAI wire-schema JSON string. It also emits `<tool_call>` XML blocks that can be truncated at `max_tokens`. This PR fixes both, plus a speculative-prefill rendering inconsistency.\n\n- **Argument mode detection** (`preprocessor/prompt.rs`): scan the Jinja template source at formatter construction for `.items()` patterns. Introduce `ToolArgumentsMode` enum and `detect_tool_arguments_mode`. Use a thread-local `ToolArgumentsModeGuard` (RAII, sync-only scope) so the mode is applied only during the synchronous `apply_template` call with no async boundary risk.\n\n- **Argument normalization** (`preprocessor/prompt.rs`): `normalize_tool_call_arguments` parses `tool_calls[*].function.arguments` from JSON string to object in `NvCreateChatCompletionRequest::messages()` when `ParsedObject` mode is active. Non-object and malformed-JSON values are replaced with `{}` and warned (by length only — no raw argument content in logs).\n\n- **Array template variants** (`preprocessor/prompt.rs`): `mdc_jinja_template_text` now handles HF configs that store `chat_template` as `[{name, template}, ...]` by scanning all variant strings, so `.items()` in any variant is detectable.\n\n- **Non-streaming recovery** (`aggregator.rs`): extract the last incomplete `<tool_call>` block before parsing. If a second block is truncated after a complete first one, it is appended to `choice.text` after parsing (the parser drops it silently otherwise).\n\n- **Streaming recovery** (`preprocessor.rs`): on `finish_reason=length`, use `rfind(\"<tool_call>\")` to recover the last block without a matching `</tool_call>`. Avoids duplicating already-emitted complete blocks. Per-choice `ChoiceRecovery` buffers input text; recovered content is emitted as a synthetic chunk before the finish chunk.\n\n- **Speculative prefill** (`preprocessor/speculative_prefill.rs`): propagate `tool_arguments_mode` into `SpeculativePrefillRequest::messages()` so the prefill render applies the same argument normalization as the main request, keeping KV prefix hashes consistent.\n\n## Validation\n\n- `cargo build -p dynamo-llm`: clean, zero warnings\n- `cargo test -p dynamo-llm`: all tests pass, including 8 new unit tests covering `detect_tool_arguments_mode`, `normalize_tool_call_arguments` (object, non-object, malformed JSON, non-assistant messages), and `mdc_jinja_template_text` (tokenizer_config.json and chat_template.json paths)\n- `cargo fmt --check -p dynamo-llm`: clean","created_at":"2026-07-27T17:03:37Z","updated_at":"2026-09-29T01:07:13Z","closed_at":"2026-09-29T01:07:13Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"keivenchang","id":213854356,"node_id":"U_kgDODL8olA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/213854356?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/keivenchang","html_url":"https://github.com/keivenchang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keivenchang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keivenchang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keivenchang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keivenchang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keivenchang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keivenchang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keivenchang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keivenchang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keivenchang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[{"id":8461525019,"node_id":"LA_kwDOOCjvss8AAAAB-FigGw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dynamo/dynamo/labels/size/XL","name":"size/XL","color":"C32607","default":false,"description":null,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":8582537231,"node_id":"LA_kwDOOCjvss8AAAAB_48gDw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dynamo/dynamo/labels/fix","name":"fix","color":"158c01","default":false,"description":null,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":8764201428,"node_id":"LA_kwDOOCjvss8AAAACCmMZ1A","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dynamo/dynamo/labels/Stale","name":"Stale","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":9261210107,"node_id":"LA_kwDOOCjvss8AAAACKALZ-w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dynamo/d